WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.401 line:92%
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.268 line:92%
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.103 line:92%
How's everybody doing tonight?

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:05.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
Fantastic.
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:05.739 size:88% position:44% line:92%
President Biden received

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:07.574 size:81% position:41%
the daily intelligence
briefing this morning.

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:12.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was just, "So, they release
the Carter picture."

00:00:12.078 --> 00:00:13.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
How is this the first

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:17.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
we're hearing about the Bidens
being 40 feet tall?

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:18.718 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:21.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
They look like
a ventriloquist act.

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:24.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know that dandelion pictur
from the other day?

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:25.325 size:78% position:39% line:92%
That was an oak tree.

00:00:25.325 --> 00:00:27.127 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
It was announced yesterday

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:28.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
that President Biden
will deliver

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:30.230 align:start size:94% position:6%
the commencement address
later this month

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.665 align:start size:94% position:6%
at the U.S. Coast Guard
Academy graduation.

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:36.169
And, while we're on the subject,
is it too late to change

00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:37.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
your Major?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:41.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ As Biden ]
Don't make me send you bac
to Scranton!

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:42.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
A White House announced
yesterday --

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:45.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
excuse me, the White House
or a White House.

00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:48.281
[ Laughter ]
We should stop being so specific

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:49.682 size:81% position:41% line:92%
about which one it is.

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:52.419 align:start size:94% position:6%
The White House announced
yesterday that President Biden

00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:56.956 align:start size:94% position:6%
is raising the annual
refugee limit to 62,500.

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:57.690 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Also rising?

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:58.858 line:92%
Tucker Carlson's blood pressure.

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:01.961 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
President Biden
asked fifth graders

00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:04.697 size:84% position:42%
at an elementary school
in Virginia yesterday

00:01:04.697 --> 00:01:07.167 align:start size:94% position:6%
what they wanted to be
when they grew up.

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:08.068 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Said students,

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:09.235 line:92%
"Covered by a healthcare pla

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:10.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
that isn't tied
to my employment."

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:14.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
Florida governor Ron DeSanti
yesterday suspended all

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:16.543 align:start size:94% position:6%
of the state's coronavirus
restrictions, and said,

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:19.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
"We are no longer
in a state of emergency,"

00:01:19.179 --> 00:01:21.147 align:start size:94% position:6%
adding,
"but it's still Florida, so,

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:21.915 line:92%
give it a couple of days."

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:24.417 align:start size:94% position:6%
Microsoft founder Bill Gates
announced yesterday

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:27.253 align:start size:94% position:6%
that he and his wife, Melinda,
will get a divorce,

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:29.089 align:start size:94% position:6%
after being married
for 27 years.

00:01:29.089 --> 00:01:31.191 align:start size:94% position:6%
Apparently,
it was an accumulation

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:32.292 line:92%
of lots of little things,

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:35.662 align:start size:94% position:6%
like how Bill would never
empty the recycling.

00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:37.430 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:41.167
That's what you get for hiring
people who used to work in IT.

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:42.302 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:44.471 align:start size:94% position:6%
Researchers in Germany
recently named

00:01:44.471 --> 00:01:47.340 align:start size:94% position:6%
a new bacteria that is linke
to lung parasites

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.943 align:start size:94% position:6%
after the Pokémon tool
Poké Balls

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:52.011 line:92%
because they're a similar shape.

00:01:52.011 --> 00:01:52.712 line:92%
Said one German doctor --

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:56.716
[ German accent ] Bad news
Ve didn't catch 'em all.

00:01:56.716 --> 00:02:00.987 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.987 --> 00:02:02.589 align:start size:94% position:6%
I should know.
I freestyled there.

00:02:02.589 --> 00:02:03.656 align:start size:94% position:6%
The joke was not
for a German doctor

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:08.495 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, the last minute,
I was like, "You know what

00:02:08.495 --> 00:02:10.730 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Let's let it rip.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:13.199 align:start size:94% position:6%
What's the worst
that could happen?"

00:02:13.199 --> 00:02:14.300 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And then, you saw

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.369 align:start size:94% position:6%
what the worst was.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.369 --> 00:02:18.071 align:start size:94% position:6%
A man in England
was arrested last week

00:02:18.071 --> 00:02:20.406 align:start size:94% position:6%
after a four miles per hou
police chase,

00:02:20.406 --> 00:02:23.810
in a narrow boat on a canal,
that lasted for eight miles,

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:26.179 align:start size:94% position:6%
which means that,
by the time they caught him,

00:02:26.179 --> 00:02:28.948 align:start size:94% position:6%
the statute of limitations
had run out.

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:30.717 line:92%
Eight people who were involved

00:02:30.717 --> 00:02:33.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the torch relay
for the Tokyo Olympic Game

00:02:33.653 --> 00:02:35.455 size:75% position:38%
have tested positive
for the coronavirus.

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:37.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, it's hard news to hear
but, at least,

00:02:37.624 --> 00:02:40.260 align:start size:94% position:6%
the contact tracing
will be easy.

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:41.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, finally,
according to a new report,

00:02:41.928 --> 00:02:43.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
the number of customers
who subscribe

00:02:43.963 --> 00:02:46.166 line:92%
to AOL's dial-up service is,

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:47.467 size:84% position:42% line:92%
"in the low thousands,"

00:02:47.467 --> 00:02:50.203
which is also their average age.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.203 --> 00:02:53.706 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that was the monologue
everybody!

